{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_13036","headline":"送崔侍御往容州宣慰 · 郎士元","name":"送崔侍御往容州宣慰","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"秦原独立望湘川，击隼南飞向楚天。\n奉诏不言空问俗，清时因得访遗贤。\n荆门晓色兼梅雨，桂水春风过客船。\n畴昔常闻陆贾说，故人今日岂徒然。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"郎士元","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_13036.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_13036","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}